  "statement_html": "\t<div style=\"border: thin solid blue;padding:1%\"><p>Determine the derivative of a function in  defined by\t \\(f(x) = u(x) \\cdot v(x)\\) with :</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\t\\(\\begin{array}{l} u(x) \\, = \\, 2 x + 5 \\\\ v(x) \\, = \\, 7 x + 1 \\end{array}\\)</div>\t<p>\tThe functions \\(u\\) and \\(v\\) are differentiable in \\(\\text{RR}\\) and :</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(u'(x)\\) =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"20\"></span> </div>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(v'(x)\\) =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"20\"></span> </div>\t<p>\tIn order to determine the derivative of \\(f\\) &nbsp; we apply the following rule of differentiation:\t</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"1\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v-uv}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"2\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v+uv}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"3\" /> \\(f' = \\mathtt{\\text{v}}\\)</label></div>\t<p>\tThe derivative function of \\(f\\) &nbsp; will be :</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(f'(x)\\) =  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"30\"></span></div>\t",
